    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Built in 1995 this distinguished five bedroom detached home in Drumathumper, Frosses delivers space, elegance and the kind of mature gardens you only get after decades of love. From the moment you step into the grand, wide hallway, the scale of this property hits you. Soaring proportions, generous rooms throughout, and a layout designed for real comfort.\n\nUpstairs, all three bedrooms are ensuite, all of which are large, bright and beautifully balanced. the kind of rooms that feel luxurious the second you walk in. Downstairs offers multiple spacious living areas perfect for family life or entertaining, with views spilling out over the gardens.\n\nAnd the gardens a gardener`s paradise. Mature planting, winding pathways, fruit trees, colour, privacy, and endless space to wander, grow, relax and enjoy. It`s the dream outdoor haven. Peaceful, established and bursting with charm in need of a few modern upgrades.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to own a substantial home with character, presence and truly exceptional grounds in one of Frosses` most soughtafter pockets."
      },
